OL,3,GNEWSAFeedback sought on assisted dying
OL,4,Astandards
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-month consultation on the
OL,7,Fstandards for the proposed assisted
OL,8,Fdying law has been launched.
OL,10,FThe Jersey Care Commission said the
OL,11,Fconsultation would give islanders and
OL,12,Fcare providers an opportunity to
OL,13,Fprovide feedback before the standards
OL,14,Fare finalised in 2027.
OL,16,FA law to allow terminally ill adults
OL,17,Fthe right to choose to end their own
OL,18,Flives was approved in Jersey in
OL,19,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
